{
  "id": "047",
  "title": "The Villainess Who Was Warned",
  "subtitle": "\"I woke up as Amara Vex, the villainess of an otome game I'd finished six times. I had until the Spring Ball to avoid beheading. I had seventy-three days.\"",
  "penName": "Harper Quinn",
  "genre": "villainessIsekai",
  "hook": "I died at twenty-seven on the 7 train in Brooklyn. I woke up as Amara Vex, sixteen-year-old daughter of Duke Vex in the kingdom of Elanor. I had played the otome game this world was based on six times. I had beheaded Amara five times. I had exiled her once. I remembered — with absolute clarity — that I had seventy-three in-game days before the Spring Ball, where the original heroine would report me to the prince and I would be arrested for abuse I had already committed in the game's canon. The canon had committed. I had not.",
  "coverPath": "covers/047.jpg",
